    {
      "text": "to what source they may look for a remission of their sins, 2 Ne. 25:26. remission of your sins by fire and by the Holy Ghost, 2 Ne. 31:17. wrestle … before I received a remission of my sins, Enos 1:2. received a remission of their sins, Mosiah 4:3 (D&C 20:5). remission of your sins, which causeth … great joy, Mosiah 4:11. retain a remission of your sins, Mosiah 4:12 (4:26). looked forward to that day for a remission, Mosiah 15:11 (Alma 13:16). have claim on mercy … unto a remission of his sins, Alma 12:34. cry out unto the Lord … for mercy, did I receive a remission, Alma 38:8. there was a great remission of sins, 3 Ne. 1:23. repentance and remission of sins through faith, 3 Ne. 7:16. repented and received a remission of their sins, 3 Ne. 7:25 (12:2; 30:2). fulfilling the commandments bringeth remission of sins, Moro. 8:25. covenant of the Father unto the remission of your sins, Moro. 10:33.",
